 ╭ Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │                                                                            │
 │ F5 Ctrl+E   Run the query            q Ctrl+Q    Quit                      │
 │ Ctrl+C      Copy row / cancel query  Enter       Select / new line         │
 │ Ctrl+A      Copy all rows            ↑           Up                        │
 │ Tab         Next panel               ↓           Down                      │
 │ Shift+Tab   Previous panel           ←           Left / previous column    │
 │ F1          Database list            →           Right / next column       │
 │ Ctrl+T      Next theme               PgUp        Page up                   │
 │ F12         Event log                PgDn        Page down                 │
 │ Space       Command menu             Home        First row / line start    │
 │ ? F2        Show keys                End         Last row / line end       │
 │ Esc         Back / close             Backspace   Delete a character        │
 │                                                                            │
 ╰───────────────────────────── any key to close ─────────────────────────────╯
